#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QTreeView, deviceView)
#: DeviceAutomounterKCM.ui:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This list contains the storage devices known to the system. If \"Automount "
"on Login\" is checked, devices will be automatically mounted even though "
"\"Mount all removable media at login\" is unchecked. The same applies for "
"\"Automount on Attach\"."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj popis sadrži uređaje za pohranu poznate sustavu. Ako je označeno "
"„Automatski montiraj pri prijavi”, uređaji će se automatski montirati iako "
"je odznačeno „Montiraj sve uklonjive medije pri prijavi”. Isto vrijedi i za "
"„Automatski montiraj pri spajanju”."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, forgetDevice)
#: DeviceAutomounterKCM.ui:54
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Clicking this button causes the selected devices to be 'forgotten'. This is "
"only useful if \"Only automatically mount removable media that has been "
"manually mounted before\" is checked. Once a device is forgotten and the "
"system is set to only automatically mount familiar devices, the device will "
"not be automatically mounted."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na ovaj gumb odabrani uređaji bit će „zaboravljeni”. Ovo je korisno "
"samo ako je označeno „Automatski montiraj samo uklonjive medije koji su već "
"ručno montirani”. Kada se uređaj zaboravi, a sustav je postavljen da "
"automatski montira samo poznate uređaje, uređaj se neće automatski montirati."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, forgetDevice)
#: DeviceAutomounterKCM.ui:57
#, kde-format
msgid "Forget Device"
msgstr "Zaboravi uređaj"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AutomountUnknownDevices)
#: DeviceAutomounterKCM.ui:67
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When this is not checked, only remembered devices will be automatically "
"mounted. A device is 'remembered' if it has ever been mounted before. For "
"instance, plugging in a USB media player to charge is not sufficient to "
"'remember' it - if the files are not accessed, it will not be automatically "
"mounted the next time it is seen. Once they have been accessed, however, the "
"device's contents will be automatically made available to the system."
msgstr ""
"Kada ovo nije označeno, automatski će se montirati samo zapamćeni uređaji. "
"Uređaj je „zapamćen” ako je ikada prije bio montiran. Na primjer, priključivanje "
"USB medijskog playera radi punjenja nije dovoljno da ga se „zapamti” – ako se "
"ne pristupi datotekama, neće se automatski montirati sljedeći put kada se "
"prepozna. Međutim, čim im se pristupi, sadržaj uređaja automatski će postati "
"dostupan sustavu."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AutomountUnknownDevices)
#: DeviceAutomounterKCM.ui:70
#, kde-format
msgid "Automatically mount removable media that have never been mounted before"
msgstr "Automatski montiraj uklonjive medije koji nikada prije nisu bili montirani"

